# Grunt lair entry orc guard hut is an authored Lair entrance.
# Its keyed O cell becomes the saved branch stair after placement.
# Source: crawl-ref/source/dat/des/branches/lair.des.
NAME: grunt_lair_entry_orc_guard_hut
TAGS:   lair_entry transparent
ORIENT: float
MONS:   bullfrog w:30 / scorpion w:20 / black bear w:20 / yak \
        / komodo dragon w:5
MONS:   patrolling orc warrior
KMONS:  P = plant / fungus
KFEAT:  O = enter_lair
NSUBST: D = 2:1 / 2 = 1` / * = P``, 1 = 3:1 / 2 = 1. / * = `
SUBST:  P = PP`, . = P:1 .:5, ` = .
: vault.validate("exit.has_exit")
# Source Lua: validate {{ return has_exit_from_glyph('O') }}
MAP
    ...@..
  ..D.P.P...
 ..D.PDPDP...
 .D.PD11PDP..
.D.PDPDPDPDP..
..PDPccccDPDP.
@PD1DcO2cP1P..
..P1Pc%`cD1DP@
.PDPDcc+cPDP..
..PDPDP`PDP.D.
 ..PDP11DP.D.
 ...PDPDP.D..
  ...P.P.D..
    ..@...
ENDMAP
